# This file is retained only as a marker for older manual-install workflows.
#
# Do not apply the former component-specific diff: RingCentral's bundled React
# paths vary by version. Use:
#
#   .\ringcentral-patch\apply-patch.ps1 -Source <RingCentral folder|zip|app.asar>
#
# The patcher finds RingCentral's declared Electron main entry, injects the
# version-tolerant renderer engine after page load, and adds the narrow preload
# bridge when an existing preload is discoverable. The resulting controls are
# limited to RingCentral's own renderer and BrowserWindow.
